-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rule 29 -- interest on costs`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the rate of interest per year` EQUALS 0.0533
-- the table: assessed costs run from the date of assessment; fixed costs from the order; agreed costs from the agreement; Parts 1, 2 and 3 costs from judgment.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the date from which the costs carry interest` `o 21 r 29(1)(a) assessed costs` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 2 2 2027) (Date 3 2 2027) (Date 4 2 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 2 2027)
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the date from which the costs carry interest` `o 21 r 29(1)(b) costs fixed by the Court` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 2 2 2027) (Date 3 2 2027) (Date 4 2 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 2 2 2027)
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the date from which the costs carry interest` `o 21 r 29(1)(c) costs agreed between the parties` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 2 2 2027) (Date 3 2 2027) (Date 4 2 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 3 2 2027)
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the date from which the costs carry interest` `o 21 r 29(1)(d) costs under Parts 1, 2 and 3 of Appendix 1 to this Order` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 2 2 2027) (Date 3 2 2027) (Date 4 2 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 4 2 2027)
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the date from which the costs carry interest` `o 21 r 29(2) costs under Part 4 of Appendix 1 to this Order` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 2 2 2027) (Date 3 2 2027) (Date 4 2 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the date from which the costs carry interest` `o 21 r 29 other costs` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 2 2 2027) (Date 3 2 2027) (Date 4 2 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
-- yes/no twin.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29 the costs carry interest at the rate of 5.33% per year` `o 21 r 29(1)(a) assessed costs` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29 the costs carry interest at the rate of 5.33% per year` `o 21 r 29(1)(b) costs fixed by the Court` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29 the costs carry interest at the rate of 5.33% per year` `o 21 r 29(1)(c) costs agreed between the parties` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29 the costs carry interest at the rate of 5.33% per year` `o 21 r 29(1)(d) costs under Parts 1, 2 and 3 of Appendix 1 to this Order` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29 the costs carry interest at the rate of 5.33% per year` `o 21 r 29(2) costs under Part 4 of Appendix 1 to this Order` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29 the costs carry interest at the rate of 5.33% per year` `o 21 r 29 other costs` EQUALS NOTHING
-- The interest on 10,000 dollars of costs for one year at 5.33% per year is 533 dollars.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the interest on the costs for one year` `o 21 r 29(1)(a) assessed costs` 10000 EQUALS JUST 533
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the interest on the costs for one year` `o 21 r 29(1)(b) costs fixed by the Court` 10000 EQUALS JUST 533
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the interest on the costs for one year` `o 21 r 29(1)(c) costs agreed between the parties` 10000 EQUALS JUST 533
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the interest on the costs for one year` `o 21 r 29(1)(d) costs under Parts 1, 2 and 3 of Appendix 1 to this Order` 2000 EQUALS JUST 106.6
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the interest on the costs for one year` `o 21 r 29(2) costs under Part 4 of Appendix 1 to this Order` 10000 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) the interest on the costs for one year` `o 21 r 29 other costs` 10000 EQUALS NOTHING
-- from the commencement date until payment.
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) interest is running on the day` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 1 2 2027) NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) interest is running on the day` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 31 1 2027) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) interest is running on the day` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 1 3 2027) (JUST (Date 1 3 2027)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 29(1) interest is running on the day` (Date 1 2 2027) (Date 2 3 2027) (JUST (Date 1 3 2027)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
